OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry after man dies in
OL,4,Asouth London home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has begun after
OL,7,Fa man in his 30s was found with serious
OL,8,Fhead injuries at a home in south
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FOfficers were called by the London Fire
OL,12,FBrigade to Poynders Road, Lambeth, at
OL,13,Fabout 20:35 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene despite the efforts of emergency
OL,17,Fservices, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,19,FHis next of kin have been informed and
OL,20,Fare being supported by specialist
OL,21,Fofficers.
